msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Who's that kid the Snake Flower guys are after? Never saw\r\n"
"him around 'til you showed back up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"He's the captain of a pretty small family based down in\r\n"
"Okinawa. What could the Snake Flower possibly want with him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Not sure. There's a chance Hamazaki is using Lau to lure\r\n"
"you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"And if they take your friend hostage, their plan's gonna\r\n"
"work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Right... I'll save him, Florist. Just watch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I haven't seen you in what, two years?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Somewhere around that, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"I didn't think I'd find you down here again. Pretty steep\r\n"
"fall from that loft up in the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Heh, you're telling me. Anyway, Majima-san here's letting\r\n"
"me borrow the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Lost the rights to my prior place after all the stuff that\r\n"
"went down two years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Guess that makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Now, about Hamazaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Right. You said there's more to it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"You bet there is. Seems he's fixing to pawn off the whole\r\n"
"resort to the Chinese once it's built."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Take a gander at this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "That's..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Yup. Lau Ka Long, leader of the Snake Flower Triad, the Chinese syndicate "
"you brought crashing down 4 years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "What does he have to do with all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Well, after he survived his first run-in with you, he\r\n"
"skulked back to China, waiting for an opportunity to\r\n"
"strike back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"That's when he found the Hamazaki Family, a far-distant branch of the Tojo "
"that so far hadn't done much more than ruffle a few feathers in a Yokohama "
"suburb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"But with the Snake Flower Triad's backing, Hamazaki laid\r\n"
"claim to every last speck of the city, a feat that saw him\r\n"
"shoot up through the Tojo Clan ranks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Next is this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "...What am I looking at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "The key here is the jumble of papers on the table."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"This is more than any old pile of scrap, though. It's a contract between "
"Hamazaki and Lau Ka Long... tying the Snake Flower Triad into the resort "
"deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "A contract? For what, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"From what I can tell, Hamazaki's planning to build some top\r\n"
"secret mega-casino under the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"That contract makes it so the Snake Flower Triad are the ones running it. "
"Probably to pay them back for helping him conquer Yokohama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"Hamazaki must be working pretty closely with Suzuki if he's\r\n"
"serious about pulling this off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Agreed. Gotta say, a small-time yakuza operation making\r\n"
"a meteoric rise like this is pretty damn unheard of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Didn't realize Hamazaki was balls deep in this shit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "One question, Florist. Why do you know all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Astute observation. The truth of it is, I was hired to dig up dirt on "
"Hamazaki about six months ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Hired? By who?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Daigo Dojima."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "What!? Ya didn't tell me Daigo was linin' your pockets!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Explain yourself, Florist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"...All right. Normally I'm not too keen on divulging my\r\n"
"clients' identities, but I think Daigo'd forgive me given\r\n"
"the circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "When did he first approach you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"A year or so back. Said he was hot on the heels of\r\n"
"a traitor in the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Hamazaki, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"I'm getting there. Anyway, Daigo came to me worried that\r\n"
"someone was conspiring to commandeer the resort deal\r\n"
"behind his back. Someone in the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"So I worked with Daigo, sent some of my boys into the family\r\n"
"offices, and pinched as much info as I could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Which is how you got your hands on that photo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"And what ya found out was, Hamazaki was schemin' to shoot\r\n"
"Daigo and Kashiwagi! Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"Whaddya mean, \"probably\"!? If I wanted ambiguous bullshit, I woulda gone "
"to a fortune teller!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Listen. I only started looking into all this again after\r\n"
"Daigo got shot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "But that's when a new actor showed up on the stage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9220"
msgid "The Florist"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9224"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9228"
msgid "Majima"
msgstr ""